---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-plan-estudio" set:html={`
<section class="hero"><div class="heroin"><div><div class="crumb">Estudio / Plan de estudio</div><div class="eyebrow">Del temario a una semana posible</div><h1>Un plan que entra en tus días y llega antes del examen</h1><p class="lead">Repartimos temas, práctica, descansos y repasos según el tiempo que realmente tenés. Sin calendarios imposibles de sostener.</p><div class="pills"><span>Sesiones realistas</span><span>Repasos incluidos</span><span>Margen antes del examen</span></div></div><div class="scene" aria-label="Calendario semanal de estudio"><div class="calendar"><div class="rings"><i></i><i></i></div><div class="week"><span class="day study">L</span><span class="day study">M</span><span class="day review">X</span><span class="day study">J</span><span class="day study">V</span><span class="day">S</span><span class="day review">D</span><span class="day">1</span><span class="day study">2</span><span class="day study">3</span><span class="day">4</span><span class="day review">5</span><span class="day">6</span><span class="day">7</span></div></div><div class="note"><small>Ritmo sugerido</small><strong id="heroPace">1,5 h por día</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="tool"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="kicker">Elegí el objetivo</div><h2>¿Para qué necesitás el plan?</h2></div><p>Un parcial, un final y una rutina semanal necesitan ritmos y márgenes diferentes.</p></div><div class="cases"><button class="case active" data-case="exam"><strong>Preparar un parcial</strong><small>Temas acotados y práctica.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="final"><strong>Rendir un final</strong><small>Programa completo y repaso acumulativo.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="routine"><strong>Ponerme al día</strong><small>Rutina semanal sostenible.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="intensive"><strong>Plan intensivo</strong><small>Poco tiempo, prioridades claras.</small></button></div>
<div class="workspace"><div class="panel form"><h3>Tu disponibilidad real</h3><p class="sub" id="caseCopy">Reservamos los últimos días para simulacro y repaso, no para aprender temas nuevos.</p><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="topics">Temas pendientes</label><input id="topics" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="12"></div><div class="field"><label for="difficulty">Dificultad promedio</label><select id="difficulty"><option value="1">Baja · 1 h por tema</option><option value="1.75" selected>Media · 1,75 h por tema</option><option value="2.5">Alta · 2,5 h por tema</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="days">Días hasta el objetivo</label><input id="days" type="number" min="2" max="180" value="21"></div><div class="field"><label for="weekday">Horas disponibles de lunes a viernes</label><input id="weekday" type="number" min="0" max="12" step=".5" value="1.5"></div><div class="field"><label for="weekend">Horas por día del fin de semana</label><input id="weekend" type="number" min="0" max="12" step=".5" value="3"></div><div class="field"><label for="session">Duración de cada bloque</label><select id="session"><option value=".42">25 min · Pomodoro</option><option value=".75" selected>45 min</option><option value="1">60 min</option><option value="1.5">90 min</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="rest">Días libres por semana</label><select id="rest"><option value="0">Ninguno</option><option value="1" selected>1 día</option><option value="2">2 días</option></select></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="calculate">Armar mi semana</button><button class="reset" id="reset">Reiniciar</button></div></div>
<aside class="panel result" aria-live="polite"><span class="badge" id="badge">Preparar un parcial</span><div class="big" id="status">Llegás con margen</div><div class="biglabel" id="summary">Necesitás 25 horas y tenés 37 disponibles</div><div class="meters"><div class="meter"><small>Horas de contenido</small><strong id="need">21 h</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Repaso y práctica</small><strong id="review">4 h</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Bloques totales</small><strong id="blocks">34</strong></div></div><div class="weekplan" id="weekPlan"></div><div class="tip" id="tip">Dejá los últimos 3 días para recuperar temas flojos, hacer un simulacro y dormir bien.</div></aside></div></div></section>
<section class="guide"><div class="wrap guide-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Un plan que se puede cumplir</div><h2>El repaso no va al final: va dentro del calendario</h2><p>Volver a un tema en distintos días mejora la retención mucho más que releerlo todo la noche anterior.</p></div><div class="checks"><div class="check"><b>Bloques concretos</b><span>Definí “resolver ejercicios 1–10”, no simplemente “estudiar matemática”.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Repaso espaciado</b><span>Volvé al tema después de 1, 3 y 7 días con preguntas o ejercicios.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Día de recuperación</b><span>Reservá margen para lo que lleve más tiempo o una jornada que no puedas cumplir.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Descanso real</b><span>Un día libre protege el ritmo; no es una falla del plan.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">Preguntas frecuentes</div><h2>Cuando el calendario se complica</h2><div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q">¿Qué hago si el plan dice que no llego?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Reducí alcance, priorizá temas de mayor peso, sumá días u horas y evitá recortar sueño para compensar.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Cuánto debería durar una sesión?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Entre 25 y 60 minutos suele funcionar bien. Para ejercicios largos podés usar bloques de 90 minutos con una pausa real.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Cómo sé qué tema priorizar?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Empezá por los temas base que habilitan otros, los más evaluados y aquellos donde hoy cometés más errores.</div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-plan-estudio')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-plan-estudio');

(()=>{const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...root.querySelectorAll(s)],fmt=n=>Number(n.toFixed(1)).toLocaleString("es-AR",{maximumFractionDigits:1});let active="exam";const presets={exam:[12,1.75,21,1.5,3,.75,1,"Reservamos los últimos días para simulacro y repaso, no para aprender temas nuevos."],final:[28,2.5,45,2,4,1,1,"Dividimos el programa en vueltas: comprensión, práctica y repaso acumulativo."],routine:[10,1.75,28,1,2,.75,2,"Priorizamos continuidad y dos días libres para sostener el hábito."],intensive:[16,2.5,10,4,6,.75,0,"Priorizamos temas de mayor peso y dejamos un repaso corto diario."]};function calculate(){const topics=+$("#topics").value,diff=+$("#difficulty").value,days=+$("#days").value,weekday=+$("#weekday").value,weekend=+$("#weekend").value,session=+$("#session").value,rest=+$("#rest").value,content=topics*diff,review=content*(active==="final"?.35:active==="intensive"?.15:.2),need=content+review,weeks=days/7,available=Math.max(0,weeks*(weekday*5+weekend*2)-weeks*rest*weekday),ok=available>=need,blocks=Math.ceil(need/session),daily=need/Math.max(1,days-Math.ceil(weeks*rest));$("#status").textContent=ok?"Llegás con margen":"Hay que ajustar el plan";$("#summary").textContent="Necesitás "+fmt(need)+" horas y tenés "+fmt(available)+" disponibles";$("#need").textContent=fmt(content)+" h";$("#review").textContent=fmt(review)+" h";$("#blocks").textContent=blocks;$("#heroPace").textContent=fmt(daily)+" h por día";$("#tip").textContent=ok?"Dejá los últimos 3 días para recuperar temas flojos, hacer un simulacro y dormir bien.":"Te faltan "+fmt(need-available)+" horas: reducí alcance, sumá tiempo o mové la fecha.";const names=["Lun","Mar","Mié","Jue","Vie","Sáb","Dom"],hours=[weekday,weekday,weekday,weekday,weekday,weekend,weekend];$("#weekPlan").innerHTML=names.map((n,i)=>`<div class="wpday"><small>${n}</small><strong>${i>=7-rest?"Libre":fmt(hours[i])+" h"}</strong></div>`).join("")}
$$("[data-case]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{active=b.dataset.case;const p=presets[active];["topics","difficulty","days","weekday","weekend","session","rest"].forEach((id,i)=>$("#"+id).value=i===5&&p[i]<1?String(p[i]).replace(/^0/,""):String(p[i]));$("#caseCopy").textContent=p[7];$("#badge").textContent=b.querySelector("strong").textContent;$$("[data-case]").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===b));calculate()}));$$("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",calculate));$("#calculate").addEventListener("click",calculate);$("#reset").addEventListener("click",()=>$("[data-case=exam]").click());$$(".faq-q").forEach(q=>q.addEventListener("click",()=>q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));calculate()})();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-plan-estudio{--blue:#174b7a;--blue2:#3b82a1;--ink:#172335;--muted:#626e7d;--line:#dce3e6;--cream:#fff8e8;--purple:#7d68ae;--lav:#eeeafa;--green:#26715c;--mint:#d6eee4;--amber:#dda944}.mockup-plan-estudio *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-plan-estudio{margin:0;font:16px/1.45 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fbfcfb}.mockup-plan-estudio button,.mockup-plan-estudio input,.mockup-plan-estudio select{font:inherit}.mockup-plan-estudio .head{height:74px;padding:0 max(24px,calc((100% - 1180px)/2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-plan-estudio .brand{font-size:19px;font-weight:900}.mockup-plan-estudio .brand b{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;margin-right:10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue);color:white}.mockup-plan-estudio .nav{display:flex;gap:28px;color:#4d5968;font-size:14px;font-weight:750}.mockup-plan-estudio .search{padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:white}.mockup-plan-estudio .hero{padding:55px 24px 62px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fafcf9 0 64%,#eeeafa 64%)}.mockup-plan-estudio .heroin{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.mockup-plan-estudio .crumb{font-size:14px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:850}.mockup-plan-estudio .eyebrow{margin-top:27px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--purple);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-plan-estudio .hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,68px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:10px 0 20px;max-width:700px}.mockup-plan-estudio .lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:650px}.mockup-plan-estudio .pills{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.mockup-plan-estudio .pills span{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:white;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-plan-estudio .scene{min-height:340px;position:relative}.mockup-plan-estudio .calendar{position:absolute;width:330px;height:270px;left:50%;top:25px;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-2deg);background:white;border:7px solid var(--blue);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 24px 40px #263e5523;padding:65px 22px 20px}.mockup-plan-estudio .calendar:before{content:"PLAN SEMANAL";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:50px;background:var(--blue);color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.mockup-plan-estudio .rings{position:absolute;left:43px;right:43px;top:-17px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-plan-estudio .rings i{width:17px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--amber);border:5px solid white}.mockup-plan-estudio .week{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:6px}.mockup-plan-estudio .day{height:42px;border-radius:7px;background:#f1f4f5;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:850}.mockup-plan-estudio .day.study{background:var(--lav);color:var(--purple)}.mockup-plan-estudio .day.review{background:var(--mint);color:var(--green)}.mockup-plan-estudio .note{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:14px;padding:12px 15px;background:var(--cream);border:1px solid #efdca7;border-radius:13px;transform:rotate(4deg);box-shadow:0 12px 24px #614c1e17}.mockup-plan-estudio .note small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-plan-estudio .note strong{font-size:20px;color:var(--purple)}
.mockup-plan-estudio .tool{padding:65px 24px}.mockup-plan-estudio .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto}.mockup-plan-estudio .sectionhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:23px}.mockup-plan-estudio .kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--purple);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-plan-estudio .sectionhead h2,.mockup-plan-estudio .guide h2,.mockup-plan-estudio .faq h2{font-size:37px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.mockup-plan-estudio .sectionhead p{max-width:510px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.mockup-plan-estudio .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:22px}.mockup-plan-estudio .case{min-height:106px;padding:17px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;background:white;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.mockup-plan-estudio .case strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-plan-estudio .case small{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-plan-estudio .case.active{border:2px solid var(--purple);padding:16px;background:#f8f6ff;box-shadow:0 9px 22px #7659a612}.mockup-plan-estudio .workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:20px}.mockup-plan-estudio .panel{padding:28px;border-radius:24px}.mockup-plan-estudio .form{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 16px 40px #17364a0d}.mockup-plan-estudio .panel h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-plan-estudio .sub{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.mockup-plan-estudio .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.mockup-plan-estudio .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-plan-estudio .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-plan-estudio .field small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}.mockup-plan-estudio input,.mockup-plan-estudio select{width:100%;min-height:50px;border:1px solid #d2dade;border-radius:12px;background:white;padding:12px 14px;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-plan-estudio .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.mockup-plan-estudio .primary{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:white;padding:14px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.mockup-plan-estudio .reset{border:1px solid var(--amber);border-radius:12px;background:white;color:#6a5121;padding:13px 17px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-plan-estudio .result{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--blue),var(--blue2));color:white}.mockup-plan-estudio .result:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:250px;height:250px;border:46px solid #ffffff0b;border-radius:50%;right:-130px;bottom:-120px}.mockup-plan-estudio .badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--mint);color:#164f40;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-plan-estudio .big{font-size:45px;line-height:1;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:14px 0 3px}.mockup-plan-estudio .biglabel{color:#dfedf2;font-size:14px}.mockup-plan-estudio .meters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;margin:20px 0}.mockup-plan-estudio .meter{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:13px;border:1px solid #ffffff2c;background:#ffffff0e;border-radius:14px}.mockup-plan-estudio .meter small{display:block;color:#dcebf1;font-size:11px}.mockup-plan-estudio .meter strong{font-size:17px}.mockup-plan-estudio .weekplan{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:6px}.mockup-plan-estudio .wpday{min-height:80px;padding:9px 5px;border:1px solid #ffffff28;background:#ffffff0f;border-radius:11px;text-align:center}.mockup-plan-estudio .wpday small{display:block;color:#dcebf1;font-size:10px}.mockup-plan-estudio .wpday strong{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px}.mockup-plan-estudio .tip{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-top:15px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--cream);color:#58482d;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.mockup-plan-estudio .guide{padding:70px 24px;background:#f4f6f5}.mockup-plan-estudio .guide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:44px}.mockup-plan-estudio .guide p{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-plan-estudio .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.mockup-plan-estudio .check{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:white}.mockup-plan-estudio .check b{display:block;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-plan-estudio .check span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-plan-estudio .faq{padding:70px 24px}.mockup-plan-estudio .faq-item{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-plan-estudio .faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 0;border:0;background:none;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-plan-estudio .faq-a{display:none;padding:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted);max-width:820px}.mockup-plan-estudio .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.mockup-plan-estudio .foot{padding:30px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:white;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:870px){.mockup-plan-estudio .nav{display:none}.mockup-plan-estudio .heroin,.mockup-plan-estudio .workspace,.mockup-plan-estudio .guide-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-plan-estudio .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-plan-estudio .sectionhead{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}}@media(max-width:570px){.mockup-plan-estudio .cases,.mockup-plan-estudio .fields,.mockup-plan-estudio .checks,.mockup-plan-estudio .meters{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-plan-estudio .weekplan{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.mockup-plan-estudio .hero h1{font-size:44px}.mockup-plan-estudio .actions{flex-direction:column}}

.mockup-plan-estudio { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-plan-estudio .top, .mockup-plan-estudio header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-plan-estudio .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-plan-estudio .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-plan-estudio .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-plan-estudio .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-plan-estudio .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-plan-estudio .support-real p { color:#52657b; line-height:1.65; }
/* Prevent the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text
   designed to inherit a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-plan-estudio :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td) { color:inherit; }
.mockup-plan-estudio input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance:textfield; appearance:textfield; }
.mockup-plan-estudio input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, .mockup-plan-estudio input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-plan-estudio .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-plan-estudio support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
